                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Really underrated game that I'd recommend to those who like Mega Man and don't mind a bit of jank. It's definitely far from perfect particularly when it comes to visuals and music selection, but I'd love to see a proper follow-up to this eventually that improves upon everything\n\nAnd yes, a character of mine is in this game since I donated to its Kickstarter many years back, but even putting any potential bias aside I don't think it's bad by any means",
